1
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:46,000
Look.

2
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:47,500
Is that Yu Changxuan?

3
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:48,640
That's him.

4
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,319
It sure is.

5
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,640
It's Yu Changxuan.

6
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:52,560
That's him.

7
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:54,159
Why is he following Ye Pingjun?

8
00:01:55,379 --> 00:01:55,859
Why would he

9
00:01:55,859 --> 00:01:56,840
be with Ye Pingjun?

10
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,200
What do you want from me?

11
00:01:58,579 --> 00:01:59,280
Isn't it obvious?

12
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,480
Walking you to school.

13
00:02:03,780 --> 00:02:04,340
No, thanks.

14
00:02:04,959 --> 00:02:06,340
When the lady refuses,

15
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:07,939
the gentleman must try harder.

16
00:02:08,139 --> 00:02:09,500
That's what courting is all about.

17
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:16,479
Shameless.

18
00:02:16,979 --> 00:02:18,280
I can be even worse.

19
00:02:18,740 --> 00:02:19,800
Do you want to find out?

20
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,919
Isn't that Mr. Yu?

21
00:02:27,419 --> 00:02:29,280
What's he doing with Ye Pingjun?

22
00:02:33,979 --> 00:02:36,000
No wonder he shot that hound for her.

23
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:38,259
He's got a new taste, huh?

24
00:02:44,639 --> 00:02:46,099
Who he walks to school with

25
00:02:46,099 --> 00:02:47,139
or spends his time with

26
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:48,699
is none of my business.

27
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:55,439
Changxuan,

28
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:56,879
we just got a tip.

29
00:02:57,580 --> 00:02:58,300
Tao Xili just secured

30
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,439
a government loan.

31
00:02:59,699 --> 00:03:00,699
The money was meant

32
00:03:00,699 --> 00:03:01,800
for flood relief,

33
00:03:02,099 --> 00:03:03,199
but the Tao and Mu families

34
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:04,340
are using it to buy Japanese arms.

35
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:06,939
It goes deep.

36
00:03:07,219 --> 00:03:08,280
Should we tell the Commander?

37
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,900
This shipment

38
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,780
will land at Xishui.

39
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,680
I'm taking that shipment.

40
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:21,580
Isn't that a bit risky?

41
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,500
The nation falls

42
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:31,060
due to incompetent generals.

43
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,340
To save the country,

44
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:35,520
nothing matters more

45
00:03:36,740 --> 00:03:37,740
than a strong military.

46
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,159
I understand.

47
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:43,300
You want

48
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:44,680
to build your army

49
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,120
with its own weapons.

50
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,539
I want

51
00:03:50,259 --> 00:03:51,800
real independence,

52
00:03:52,539 --> 00:03:53,900
not to be a pawn

53
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,340
to be pushed around.

54
00:03:57,580 --> 00:04:00,199
But with just our men,

55
00:04:00,199 --> 00:04:01,740
seizing that shipment

56
00:04:01,819 --> 00:04:02,520
will be difficult.

57
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,840
That's why

58
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,099
I'll work

59
00:04:06,099 --> 00:04:07,639
with Marshal Xu's trusted officer.

60
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:09,560
You mean

61
00:04:10,419 --> 00:04:11,000
Staff Officer Yang?

62
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:11,479
Staff Officer Li.

63
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:14,219
Changxuan.

64
00:04:15,819 --> 00:04:17,279
That was a sly move.

65
00:04:17,639 --> 00:04:18,779
What are you talking about?

66
00:04:20,339 --> 00:04:22,180
The land on Changping Mountain.

67
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:24,480
It belongs to Tao Ziyi's uncle, right?

68
00:04:24,759 --> 00:04:26,120
You played hot and cold

69
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,779
with her, trying to bait her,

70
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,379
all for that land.

71
00:04:29,379 --> 00:04:29,879
Am I right?

72
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:32,339
You're getting smarter, huh?

73
00:04:33,339 --> 00:04:34,680
I'm sharp as a whip.

74
00:04:41,379 --> 00:04:42,480
No wonder.

75
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:46,339
I thought Ye Pingjun

76
00:04:46,339 --> 00:04:47,579
was pretty enough,

77
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,279
but hardly your type.

78
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:51,139
Turns out you were using her

79
00:04:51,139 --> 00:04:52,899
to make Tao Ziyi jealous.

80
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:57,079
Oh, Changxuan.

81
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,439
Why hide it from me?

82
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,519
When it comes to romance,

83
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,519
I'm the expert.

84
00:05:02,939 --> 00:05:03,579
Tell you what,

85
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:05,860
I'll make Tao Ziyi bow to you.

86
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,939
Leave it to me.

87
00:05:07,980 --> 00:05:09,579
I'll pave the way,

88
00:05:09,579 --> 00:05:11,379
nice and smooth.

89
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:12,399
What do you say?

90
00:05:16,379 --> 00:05:17,040
Miss Ye,

91
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:18,339
Lanqing showed me

92
00:05:18,579 --> 00:05:19,860
your script the other day.

93
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:20,699
I read it.

94
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:22,220
It's quite good.

95
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:23,339
Your writing

96
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:25,079
doesn't read like a student's.

97
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:25,819
More like

98
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:27,439
a seasoned pro.

99
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,680
Director Liang, you flatter me.

100
00:05:30,699 --> 00:05:31,540
Actually,

101
00:05:31,579 --> 00:05:33,480
I just read a few books

102
00:05:33,620 --> 00:05:35,399
and tried writing a bit.

103
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:36,519
Pingjun,

104
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:38,800
Director Liang truly admires your work.

105
00:05:39,100 --> 00:05:40,279
Once your play is staged,

106
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,939
I'm sure it'll be better

107
00:05:41,939 --> 00:05:43,019
than anything out there.

108
00:05:43,100 --> 00:05:43,800
Absolutely.

109
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,079
Lanqing,

110
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:49,300
Changxuan sent word.

111
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:50,639
He'll be over soon.

112
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,160
All right.

113
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,300
Oh, right, Lanqing.

114
00:05:54,300 --> 00:05:54,959
I need to get home

115
00:05:54,959 --> 00:05:56,040
to get the medicine for my mother.

116
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,019
I'd better get going.

117
00:05:58,279 --> 00:05:58,819
All right.

118
00:05:59,100 --> 00:05:59,959
Take care.

119
00:06:01,379 --> 00:06:02,000
Goodbye.

120
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:03,819
Take care.

121
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:08,079
See you.

122
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,620
Just you here?

123
00:06:27,139 --> 00:06:28,040
Stop looking.

124
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,079
She left a while ago.

125
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,180
Who's looking?

126
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:35,100
I came here to see you.

127
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:37,839
It's all over town.

128
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:40,040
They say you're chasing Pingjun,

129
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:41,740
making such a scene

130
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:43,040
at the girls' school.

131
00:06:46,259 --> 00:06:46,899
What?

132
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:48,319
Jealous?

133
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:53,540
Stop being ridiculous.

134
00:06:53,759 --> 00:06:54,680
I'm warning you.

135
00:06:55,259 --> 00:06:56,579
Cut it out.

136
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,839
Pingjun is innocent.

137
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,839
I see her as a little sister.

138
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:05,040
You've only known her for a few days,

139
00:07:05,300 --> 00:07:06,439
and you're defending her?

140
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:08,480
She's not like your

141
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,819
flings and groupies.

142
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,240
She's a decent girl.

143
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,519
Funny,

144
00:07:17,579 --> 00:07:19,240
I was just looking

145
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:22,079
for a decent new friend.

146
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,339
See you tomorrow.

147
00:07:34,459 --> 00:07:35,160
Bye.

148
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,000
See you.

149
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:37,759
Class was hard today.

150
00:07:41,139 --> 00:07:41,639
Pingjun,

151
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:43,439
the homework you do for us

152
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:44,139
keeps getting better.

153
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:45,339
We're very happy.

154
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:46,860
They opened a new

155
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:48,439
skating rink at Drum Tower.

156
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,740
We're going to try it.

157
00:07:49,839 --> 00:07:50,480
Come with us.

158
00:07:52,139 --> 00:07:52,860
I can't skate.

159
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:54,120
I'd only spoil your fun.

160
00:07:54,339 --> 00:07:55,199
I'll pass.

161
00:07:57,300 --> 00:07:58,660
Other students at our school

162
00:07:58,660 --> 00:07:59,639
do homework for money too.

163
00:07:59,699 --> 00:08:01,139
But we always come to you.

164
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,319
It's our first time inviting you.

165
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,839
Don't turn us down.

166
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,240
It's fine if you can't skate.

167
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,579
We'll teach you.

168
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:07,899
Come on.

169
00:08:07,899 --> 00:08:08,839
The more, the merrier.

170
00:08:08,899 --> 00:08:10,000
Come on. It'll be fun.

171
00:08:19,879 --> 00:08:20,680
Ye Pingjun,

172
00:08:20,860 --> 00:08:21,920
what are you doing?

173
00:08:22,180 --> 00:08:23,019
Get over here.

174
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,800
Holding on like that,

175
00:08:25,899 --> 00:08:27,339
you'll never learn.

176
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,459
To skate,

177
00:08:28,459 --> 00:08:29,879
you can't be afraid to fall.

178
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:30,620
Exactly.

179
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:32,740
Let's help her skate.

180
00:08:32,740 --> 00:08:33,340
Come on.

181
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:34,559
Let's go.

182
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:40,639
Keep your balance.

183
00:08:40,980 --> 00:08:42,059
Skating is easy.

184
00:08:42,059 --> 00:08:42,899
You'll get it in no time.

185
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,639
Exactly.

186
00:09:10,299 --> 00:09:11,440
Sorry.

187
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:12,340
I couldn't stop.

188
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,460
Are you okay?

189
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:27,740
I'm so sorry.

190
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,019
I didn't see you there.

191
00:09:52,460 --> 00:09:53,759
Be more careful.

192
00:09:53,779 --> 00:09:54,860
Watch where you're going.

193
00:09:54,940 --> 00:09:56,360
Yeah. What's wrong with you?

194
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:22,940
It's roller skating.

195
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:25,159
Falling is normal.

196
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:26,879
If you can't skate, I'll teach you.

197
00:10:27,639 --> 00:10:29,399
Busy. I'm leaving.

198
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,139
What are you doing?

199
00:10:33,419 --> 00:10:33,840
How dare you?

200
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,360
My arm.

201
00:10:37,019 --> 00:10:37,980
Ye Pingjun,

202
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:40,240
how dare you knock me over?

203
00:10:43,220 --> 00:10:44,100
It's roller skating.

204
00:10:45,539 --> 00:10:47,259
Bumping into people is normal.

205
00:10:47,899 --> 00:10:48,860
I'll be more careful next time.

206
00:10:56,779 --> 00:10:57,639
Are you okay?

207
00:10:58,299 --> 00:10:59,559
Get up. Easy now.

208
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,279
You okay?

209
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:31,779
Do you need to go to the hospital?

210
00:11:32,259 --> 00:11:32,639
I'll take you.

211
00:11:37,539 --> 00:11:39,000
I won't trouble you, Mr. Yu.

212
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:45,600
No trouble. I'm heading that way.

213
00:11:51,019 --> 00:11:51,700
This way.

214
00:11:55,539 --> 00:11:56,059
Get in.

215
00:12:11,659 --> 00:12:13,039
You are really not going to the hospital?

216
00:12:15,139 --> 00:12:15,700
No.

217
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:19,360
Next Wednesday is my birthday.

218
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:20,720
I want you

219
00:12:21,139 --> 00:12:21,980
to be my date

220
00:12:21,980 --> 00:12:22,639
and come with me.

221
00:12:24,500 --> 00:12:25,179
No way.

222
00:12:28,299 --> 00:12:29,299
Don't you want your contract back?

223
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:33,720
If it goes well,

224
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:35,480
I'll cut six months

225
00:12:35,759 --> 00:12:36,799
off your one-year contract.

226
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:40,879
Deal?

227
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:44,980
Deal.

228
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:03,720
Changxuan,

229
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,440
ignore their gold and silver.

230
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,840
This is what you need.

231
00:13:08,679 --> 00:13:10,139
Top-grade huangqi.

232
00:13:10,980 --> 00:13:13,000
Great for your health.

233
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:14,440
And I handpicked

234
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,759
every single piece myself.

235
00:13:15,759 --> 00:13:16,340
How thoughtful.

236
00:13:17,679 --> 00:13:18,659
Ye Pingjun?

237
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:20,960
Why is she here?

238
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:23,580
Exactly.

239
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:26,220
Isn't she the brat

240
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,120
from the Hsiang Hsi Hotel?

241
00:13:27,580 --> 00:13:28,720
She's not afraid you'll get even?

242
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,340
Didn't you know?

243
00:13:29,639 --> 00:13:30,659
Changxuan's courting her.

244
00:13:30,799 --> 00:13:31,919
For real?

245
00:13:36,559 --> 00:13:38,200
Miss Ye is my guest.

246
00:13:38,620 --> 00:13:40,139
Any past misunderstandings aside,

247
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:41,039
from now on,

248
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:42,799
we're all friends.

249
00:13:45,980 --> 00:13:47,299
Miss Ye,

250
00:13:47,379 --> 00:13:48,779
I was out of line earlier.

251
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:50,039
Please forgive me.

252
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,200
I went too far.

253
00:13:52,539 --> 00:13:53,240
Sorry.

254
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:00,799
This German pistol

255
00:14:00,799 --> 00:14:01,919
was custom-made for you.

256
00:14:02,139 --> 00:14:03,600
Even a British duke uses one.

257
00:14:03,659 --> 00:14:04,620
It's a tiger statue,

258
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,120
symbolizing wealth and peace.

259
00:14:06,220 --> 00:14:07,320
Please accept it.

260
00:14:07,679 --> 00:14:08,740
I had this riding crop

261
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:09,860
brought from England.

262
00:14:10,539 --> 00:14:11,600
Rhino horn handle.

263
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,379
Fine calfskin lash.

264
00:14:13,779 --> 00:14:14,960
See if it suits you.

265
00:14:15,179 --> 00:14:16,200
Thanks, Yayi.

266
00:14:16,340 --> 00:14:17,019
I love it.

267
00:14:17,759 --> 00:14:18,899
Miss Tao really knows

268
00:14:18,899 --> 00:14:20,200
what Changxuan likes.

269
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,639
Absolutely.

270
00:14:21,639 --> 00:14:22,460
Miss Ye,

271
00:14:22,919 --> 00:14:23,919
what gift did you

272
00:14:23,919 --> 00:14:24,820
prepare for him?

273
00:14:28,259 --> 00:14:28,940
I know

274
00:14:29,139 --> 00:14:30,960
you have expensive tastes.

275
00:14:31,340 --> 00:14:33,360
I couldn't afford a birthday cake,

276
00:14:33,639 --> 00:14:35,399
so I made one myself.

277
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,840
I hope you won't mind.

278
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:50,240
What's that supposed to be?

279
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,899
Is that Changxuan?

280
00:14:54,259 --> 00:14:55,799
Pretty abstract.

281
00:14:56,059 --> 00:14:57,039
It's him.

282
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:58,799
Well, to be fair,

283
00:14:59,639 --> 00:15:00,360
this thing

284
00:15:01,039 --> 00:15:02,720
is abstract, sure,

285
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,899
but it really

286
00:15:03,899 --> 00:15:05,100
captures the spirit.

287
00:15:05,879 --> 00:15:07,320
Yes, the spirit.

288
00:15:11,639 --> 00:15:12,840
It may not look perfect,

289
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,539
but you can tell

290
00:15:13,539 --> 00:15:15,120
she put a lot of thought into it.

291
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:16,960
It's the thought

292
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:19,440
that makes me love it.

293
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,639
I'm glad you like it.

294
00:15:21,779 --> 00:15:22,399
Well then,

295
00:15:23,159 --> 00:15:24,279
let's light the candles and make a wish.

296
00:15:46,899 --> 00:15:48,200
Great. Congrats.

297
00:15:53,340 --> 00:15:53,899
Miss Ye.

298
00:15:54,659 --> 00:15:55,580
