Premier Rui has no chance.

598
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:48,440
Premier Rui is at his peak.

599
00:33:51,140 --> 00:33:53,640
Why would he lose?

600
00:33:56,920 --> 00:33:57,420
All right.

601
00:33:57,420 --> 00:33:58,180
Yours is done.

602
00:33:58,680 --> 00:33:59,539
What would you like to say?

603
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:01,880
Miss, please tell my mother

604
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,579
I got the cotton shoes

605
00:34:03,579 --> 00:34:04,460
she sent me last time.

606
00:34:04,740 --> 00:34:05,119
Sure.

607
00:34:05,579 --> 00:34:06,140
Anything else?

608
00:34:07,220 --> 00:34:07,839
That's it for now.

609
00:34:08,139 --> 00:34:08,840
All right.

610
00:34:08,840 --> 00:34:09,579
My turn.

611
00:34:09,780 --> 00:34:10,300
Miss,

612
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:11,260
please tell my father

613
00:34:11,579 --> 00:34:12,480
not to overwork

614
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:13,340
during the harvest.

615
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:14,380
He can

616
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:15,579
ask my uncles for help.

617
00:34:15,719 --> 00:34:15,960
Okay.

618
00:34:16,059 --> 00:34:16,739
When I get home,

619
00:34:16,739 --> 00:34:17,840
I'll thank them in person.

620
00:34:18,199 --> 00:34:18,880
Got it.

621
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:19,380
Oh, right.

622
00:34:19,519 --> 00:34:20,639
I want to write to my father too.

623
00:34:21,019 --> 00:34:22,420
And I need to write to my mother.

624
00:34:22,820 --> 00:34:23,860
Easy. One at a time.

625
00:34:23,960 --> 00:34:24,599
Yours first.

626
00:34:24,659 --> 00:34:25,159
Good.

627
00:34:25,219 --> 00:34:25,619
Okay.

628
00:34:25,679 --> 00:34:26,400
I just can't read.

629
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:27,019
The harvest...

630
00:34:29,380 --> 00:34:30,000
Pu.

631
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:30,860
Look.

632
00:34:31,059 --> 00:34:32,099
This is mine.

633
00:34:57,420 --> 00:34:58,920
What time is it?

634
00:35:06,059 --> 00:35:07,239
Why aren't they back yet?

635
00:35:09,420 --> 00:35:10,440
Don't worry.

636
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:12,260
Director Gu sent men to look.

637
00:35:13,239 --> 00:35:15,840
Maybe they stopped for the view

638
00:35:16,039 --> 00:35:17,159
and lost track of time.

639
00:35:19,460 --> 00:35:20,460
I think

640
00:35:20,639 --> 00:35:22,980
perhaps they're lost in the moment,

641
00:35:23,019 --> 00:35:25,119
spending the night together.

642
00:35:27,539 --> 00:35:28,739
Why slap me again?

643
00:35:29,519 --> 00:35:30,519
Because you're shameless.

644
00:35:31,119 --> 00:35:31,880
Shameless?

645
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:32,639
Ziyi.

646
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:34,079
I...

647
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:35,340
Wait...

648
00:35:36,039 --> 00:35:37,139
Was I shameless just now?

649
00:35:44,780 --> 00:35:45,619
Mr. Yu,

650
00:35:46,340 --> 00:35:47,360
I won't see you off.

651
00:35:48,139 --> 00:35:48,800
Until next time.

652
00:35:49,539 --> 00:35:50,079
Until next time.

653
00:35:59,579 --> 00:36:00,119
Staff Officer Yang.

654
00:36:00,719 --> 00:36:01,840
I don't get it.

655
00:36:02,139 --> 00:36:03,199
Why agree to work

656
00:36:03,260 --> 00:36:04,179
with that playboy?

657
00:36:08,599 --> 00:36:10,340
Premier Rui is at his peak.

658
00:36:10,780 --> 00:36:12,980
Why would he lose?

659
00:36:13,480 --> 00:36:14,179
First,

660
00:36:16,139 --> 00:36:17,739
when we lost Shandong,

661
00:36:18,380 --> 00:36:20,380
Premier Rui didn't defend our interests.

662
00:36:20,619 --> 00:36:22,639
Instead, he crushed the protests,

663
00:36:22,699 --> 00:36:23,719
losing public support.

664
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,559
Second,

665
00:36:26,119 --> 00:36:26,800
he has never had

666
00:36:26,800 --> 00:36:28,139
an army truly loyal to him.

667
00:36:28,380 --> 00:36:29,280
His divisions

668
00:36:29,639 --> 00:36:31,960
are a patchwork of rival forces.

669
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:35,340
That's why I'm betting on Mr. Cheng.

670
00:36:36,280 --> 00:36:37,219
If Marshal Xu

671
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:39,039
can modernize his weapons

672
00:36:39,659 --> 00:36:41,139
and prove himself

673
00:36:41,280 --> 00:36:42,199
among Mr. Cheng's allies,

674
00:36:43,159 --> 00:36:45,119
he'll have a real shot

675
00:36:45,860 --> 00:36:47,239
at entering central power.

676
00:36:51,980 --> 00:36:53,239
Outdated weapons

677
00:36:53,739 --> 00:36:55,840
and being shut out of power

678
00:36:56,139 --> 00:36:57,260
have always been

679
00:36:57,260 --> 00:36:58,539
the Marshal's biggest concerns.

680
00:37:00,739 --> 00:37:02,019
As for Yu Changxuan,

681
00:37:03,119 --> 00:37:04,739
we've never worked with him before,

682
00:37:04,739 --> 00:37:06,019
but everything he said

683
00:37:06,019 --> 00:37:08,340
was exactly what the Marshal wanted.

684
00:37:23,579 --> 00:37:26,239
You've been sneaking around for days.

685
00:37:26,619 --> 00:37:28,440
What are you up to?

686
00:37:29,619 --> 00:37:30,679
You're smart

687
00:37:30,980 --> 00:37:31,940
and quick-witted.

688
00:37:33,099 --> 00:37:34,340
But your memory is poor.

689
00:37:38,460 --> 00:37:40,119
The more you know,

690
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,119
the sooner you die.

691
00:37:47,380 --> 00:37:48,820
Can we go back now?

692
00:37:50,139 --> 00:37:51,480
We stay through the night.

693
00:37:52,340 --> 00:37:53,360
If anyone asks,

694
00:37:54,139 --> 00:37:54,480
tell them

695
00:37:54,480 --> 00:37:55,639
you were with me all night.

696
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:56,360
No.

697
00:37:57,940 --> 00:37:59,619
If I agree to that,

698
00:38:00,059 --> 00:38:01,440
my reputation will be ruined.

699
00:38:04,739 --> 00:38:05,400
You're already

700
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:06,519
known as my girl.

701
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:08,019
Even if you deny it,

702
00:38:08,880 --> 00:38:09,739
everyone will think

703
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:11,159
something happened.

704
00:38:14,039 --> 00:38:15,920
I've never seen anyone like you.

705
00:38:16,739 --> 00:38:18,440
You'll do anything to get your way

706
00:38:18,519 --> 00:38:20,199
and feel no shame about it.

707
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:22,980
Keep talking back,

708
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:24,579
and you'll never

709
00:38:24,579 --> 00:38:25,960
get that contract back.

710
00:39:13,420 --> 00:39:14,239
What are you reading?

711
00:39:20,380 --> 00:39:21,840
Mu Guiying Takes Command?

712
00:39:23,460 --> 00:39:24,440
Pingjun,

713
00:39:24,639 --> 00:39:25,920
you are a true heroine.

714
00:39:28,320 --> 00:39:29,199
What are you reading?

715
00:39:38,480 --> 00:39:39,980
You are a true playboy.

716
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,559
I grabbed it from the drawer.

717
00:39:43,559 --> 00:39:44,159
I didn't even look.

718
00:39:46,039 --> 00:39:47,780
Typical of Li Boren.

719
00:40:47,260 --> 00:40:48,619
The boat's so tiny, and you think

720
00:40:48,920 --> 00:40:49,820
you can get away from me?

721
00:40:55,199 --> 00:40:56,639
From now on, when I speak to you,

722
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,480
you look me in the eye.

723
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:01,099
You like people who obey?

724
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:03,519
No.

725
00:41:04,739 --> 00:41:06,139
I like the defiant ones.

726
00:41:08,780 --> 00:41:09,480
What I really enjoy

727
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,679
is watching someone defiant

728
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:13,360
finally give in.

729
00:41:39,539 --> 00:41:52,380
♪Beautiful flowers♪

730
00:41:53,880 --> 00:41:54,440
Listen.

731
00:41:55,059 --> 00:41:55,980
Isn't it lovely?

732
00:41:58,519 --> 00:41:59,579
A little true affection,

733
00:42:00,400 --> 00:42:01,679
a shallow grave,

734
00:42:03,019 --> 00:42:04,000
and the fading evening sun.

735
00:42:07,320 --> 00:42:08,659
A little bit of true feeling

736
00:42:09,780 --> 00:42:10,940
is like a ray of sunlight.

737
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:15,300
Someday, it'll come.

738
00:42:24,139 --> 00:42:25,619
Love needn't last forever.

739
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:27,340
A fleeting moment is enough.

740
00:42:28,320 --> 00:42:29,280
Do you think

741
00:42:29,280 --> 00:42:30,300
any girl in the world

742
00:42:30,440 --> 00:42:31,000
would fall

743
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:32,340
for such heartless sweet talk?

744
00:42:33,059 --> 00:42:33,880
Only playboys

745
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:34,960
like you

746
00:42:35,519 --> 00:42:36,679
would take such nonsense

747
00:42:36,679 --> 00:42:37,579
as truth

748
00:42:38,119 --> 00:42:39,539
and feel proud of it.
